WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.610
Four darts thud into the board.

2
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.770
They land so close together
they almost touch.

3
00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:08.490
But the whole group is
far from the bullseye.

4
00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:11.170
Is that a good throw, or a bad one?

5
00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:13.470
It depends on what you mean by good.

6
00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:16.470
In this mission, you'll name
the variables in an experiment,

7
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.210
and choose instruments
with the right resolution.

8
00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:23.010
You'll find out why accuracy
and precision are not the same

9
00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:26.930
thing, and tell random errors
from systematic errors.

10
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.810
Your mission: decide whether
the darts were a good throw.
